title: "FrameSync"
abstract: "CCSDS frame-level link performance harness over existing codecs — attached sync marker correlation, acquisition/flywheel/loss state machine, slip and false-sync statistics, frame-error rate versus Eb/N0 for uncoded, RS(255,223) and convolutionally coded links. Not a codec and not a packet parser."
